OL,3,GNEWSARelief measures for farmers hit by
OL,4,Abluetongue
OL,5,
OL,6,FFarmers affected by the bluetongue
OL,7,Foutbreak will get extra support to help
OL,8,Fthem navigate the crisis, a council has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FBluetongue disease, which affects the
OL,12,Fhealth and fertility of sheep, cattle
OL,13,Fand other animals, has had a
OL,14,Fsignificant impact in Devon and
OL,15,FCornwall.
OL,17,FDevon County Council said its cabinet
OL,18,Fhad agreed measures allowing tenants of
OL,19,Fits Farms Estate who have been hit
OL,20,Ffinancially by confirmed bluetongue
OL,21,Fincidents to be offered "flexible"
OL,22,Frental arrangements.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
