OL,3,GNEWSARelief measures for farmers hit by
OL,4,Abluetongue
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Cheryl Cottle-Hunkin, a
OL,7,Fcabinet member and farmer said rental
OL,8,Fpayment plans could provide some
OL,9,F"welcome breathing space" at an
OL,10,F"incredibly difficult time".
